\par\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s latest claim? That he has moderate  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  views \u8211\'20\'13 but don\u8217\'20\'19t be fooled\b0\par\par\uc2 Arwa Mahdawi \par \uc2 1,443 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 April 2024\par 13:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Trump is walking a tricky tightrope trying to appeal to his evangelical base and moderate voters. His solution? A bunch of contradictory nonsense\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  conundrum\par \par \uc2 In recent years, \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has sold NFTs, sneakers, and bibles. Now the perennial marketer is busy selling a new and improved version of himself to voters. Meet Don 2.0: a reasonable man with moderate views on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Hang on a second, you might say. Trump? The guy {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/2016/03/30/472444293/trump-calls-for-punishing-women-who-have-abortions-then-backtracks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 who, in 2016, said}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cthere has to be some form of punishment\u8221\'20\'1D for women who get abortions? The guy {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/trump-overturning-roe-v-wade/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 who can\u8217\'20\'19t stop bragging}}}\uc2  about how he is responsible for overturning Roe v Wade because he filled the supreme court with conservative justices? The guy who, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/03/19/politics/trump-thinking-in-terms-of-15-week-federal-abortion-ban/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 just a few weeks ago}}}\uc2 , was pondering a 15-week national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban? That guy has now moderated his views on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ?\par \par \uc2 Yes, I know, it\u8217\'20\'19s tough to believe but, stay with me here, Trump has turned over a new leaf! On Wednesday the former president suggested that everyone should ignore all the extreme things he\u8217\'20\'19s said about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the past\u8211\'20\'13not to mention his track record on reproductive rights\u8211\'20\'13and, instead, trust that he would never implement a federal ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Speaking to reporters on Wednesday, Trump said that, if elected president again, he wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/04/10/politics/trump-says-he-wouldnt-sign-federal-abortion-ban/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sign a national \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ban even if it passed Congress.\par \par \uc2 So should we take his word for this or \u8211\'20\'13 and I know this is something of a shocking suggestion \u8211\'20\'13 is a man who has been charged {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.citizensforethics.org/reports-investigations/crew-reports/trumps-91-criminal-charges-and-where-they-stand/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 with 88 criminal offenses}}}\uc2  in four criminal cases just spouting lies to make himself more electable? It\u8217\'20\'19s honestly very difficult to say.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s certainly politically expedient for Trump to tone down his rhetoric on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and repeat the talking point that he\u8217\'20\'19s not going to do anything, it\u8217\'20\'19s all for individual states to decide. Reproductive rights are at the centre of the Biden administration\u8217\'20\'19s re-election efforts and the Democrats have just launched a new multimillion-dollar advertising campaign that makes it clear that Trump is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2024/04/11/biden-campaign-trump-abortion-00151656"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 responsible for overturning Roe v Wade}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  did this,\u8221\'20\'1D proclaims the end of one ad, which features a Texas woman who faced life-threatening conditions after miscarrying and being denied a medically necessary \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Trump is also facing pressure to look more moderate following backlash from extremist policies his presidency helped to enable. In February, for example, an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/society/2024/feb/23/fertility-doctors-reaction-alabama-embryo-ruling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alabama supreme court ruling}}}\uc2  declared that IVF embryos are \u8216\'20\'18extrauterine children,\u8217\'20\'19 effectively shutting down IVF treatment in the state. The fallout from this prompted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/trump-ivf-abortion-alabama-republicans-8215336740a5963b57bbd970b47bb3a7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump to say}}}\uc2  he would \u8220\'20\'1Cstrongly support the availability of IVF\u8221\'20\'1D and call on Alabama to protect the fertility treatment. (In March Alabama {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/mar/07/alabama-ivf-protection-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 passed a law}}}\uc2  protecting IVF providers from liability.)\par \par \uc2 This week, Arizona also made headlines with a scene that looked like it was straight out of The Handmaid\u8217\'20\'19s Tale. On Monday a far-right Arizona state senator led a prayer circle in the state senate where worshippers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.yahoo.com/news/arizona-state-senator-leads-prayer-111314503.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spoke in tongues}}}\uc2  and prayed for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban from 1864 to become law again. (Do watch the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/tcani/status/1777829756400263618?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1777829756400263618%7Ctwgr%5Eb18cdca19278f2f0c3a1fa09a5f0295f29d3b8a1%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.huffpost.com%2Fentry%2Fanthony-kern-prayer-circle-abortion_n_6616590be4b02edf20089de3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 video}}}\uc2 , it\u8217\'20\'19s bonkers.) Their prayers were answered the next day as the Arizona supreme court ruled the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/apr/10/arizona-republicans-block-repeal-state-abortion-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 1864 law could go into effect}}}\uc2 , banning almost all abortions without any exceptions for rape or incest.\par \par \uc2 What happened in Arizona was so extreme that Trump basically had no choice but to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/apr/10/trump-arizona-abortion-ban-"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 distance himself from it}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CYeah, they did [go too far],\u8221\'20\'1D Trump told reporters on Wednesday. He then vaguely promised that the ruling would get \u8220\'20\'1Cstraightened out\u8221\'20\'1D and reiterated his talking point that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights should be left to state governments.\par \par \uc2 With the election drawing closer, Trump finds himself walking a tricky tightrope when it comes to reproductive rights. On the one hand, he has to appeal to his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2024/03/15/5-facts-about-religion-and-americans-views-of-donald-trump/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 evangelical base}}}\uc2  who want him to push for a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/election-2024-trump-abortion-views-conservative-evangelicals-d9a0286c809da48d65e5349cad8d1209"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 national \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  ban}}}\uc2 . On the other hand, he can\u8217\'20\'19t risk looking too extreme and alienating more moderate conservatives. His solution to this conundrum? Do what he does best: disorient everyone by spouting a bunch of contradictory nonsense.\par \par \uc2 By now it should be clear that nothing Trump says can be trusted. And yet, as Margaret Sullivan pointed out in her {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2024/apr/11/abortion-rights-trump-presidency-arizona"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Guardian column}}}\uc2  this week, large swathes of the media are reporting Trump\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cnew and improved\u8221\'20\'1D stance on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  as if it\u8217\'20\'19s fact, rather than opportunistic politicking. \u8220\'20\'1CToo many in the mainstream media swallowed [Trump\u8217\'20\'19s more moderate stance on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ] whole, at least in all-important headlines, presenting Trump\u8217\'20\'19s position not only as news but as a politically savvy move toward the center,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2024/apr/11/abortion-rights-trump-presidency-arizona"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sullivan wrote}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s recent comments on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  are certainly politically savvy, but don\u8217\'20\'19t be fooled: he\u8217\'20\'19s not moving even an inch towards the centre. Trump has shown us time and time again who he is. Anyone who thinks he wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t restrict \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights even further if he became president hasn\u8217\'20\'19t been paying attention.\par \par \uc2 A new study explains why lesbians report more orgasms than straight women\par \par \uc2 Several studies have found that women who sleep with women have better sex than their {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2018/jul/09/do-lesbians-have-better-sex-than-straight-women"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 heterosexual peers}}}\uc2 . I\u8217\'20\'19m fairly sure you don\u8217\'20\'19t need to do an in-depth research analysis to figure out why, but academics recently did one anyway. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/nbc-out/out-health-and-wellness/new-research-helps-explain-lesbians-report-orgasms-straight-women-rcna146661"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Their findings?}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CWhen women are having sex with men, in general, they\u8217\'20\'19re typically not experiencing enough clitoral stimulation to facilitate an equal opportunity for orgasm.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Newborns are dying preventable deaths in Gaza\u8217\'20\'19s primary maternity hospital\par \par \uc2 Israel\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://malaysia.news.yahoo.com/elizabeth-warren-suggests-israel-actions-040132904.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 genocidal}}}\uc2  assault on Gaza has decimated the healthcare system and left prenatal care almost non-existent. Speaking to Jezebel, a \uc2 Unicef\uc2  spokesperson said up to three preterm babies or babies with birth defects or other congenital issues die every day at the semi-operational Emirate Maternity hospital. All of these are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.jezebel.com/inside-gazas-primary-maternity-hospital-where-babies-are-being-born-smaller-premature-and-with-congenital-disorders"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 preventable deaths}}}\uc2  that doctors are simply \u8220\'20\'1Cunable to treat\u8221\'20\'1D due to \u8220\'20\'1Clack of specialists, specialist equipment, lack of resources\u8221\'20\'1D. Even if these babies were to survive, of course, they would risk dying of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/apr/09/famine-looms-northern-gaza-israel-opens-new-aid-routes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 famine}}}\uc2 . How can Joe Biden, a man who has lost a child himself, sleep at night knowing he is enabling these horrors? The answer is simple: he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.newyorker.com/news/q-and-a/bidens-increasingly-contradictory-israel-policy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 does not view Palestinians as humans}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CDo I think that Joe Biden has the same depth of feeling and empathy for the Palestinians of Gaza as he does for the Israelis?\u8221\'20\'1D a former state department recently said in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.newyorker.com/news/q-and-a/bidens-increasingly-contradictory-israel-policy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an interview with the New Yorker}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CNo, he doesn\u8217\'20\'19t, nor does he convey it. I don\u8217\'20\'19t think there\u8217\'20\'19s any doubt about that.\u8221\'20\'1D There certainly isn\u8217\'20\'19t.\par \par \uc2 What has 20 years of banning headscarves done for France?\par \par \uc2 Nothing positive, says {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2024/apr/12/ban-headscarves-france-secularism-exclusion-intolerance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Rokhaya Diallo in the Guardian}}}\uc2 . What was sold as a defense of secularism \u8220\'20\'1Chas opened the floodgates of intolerance and become a tool for exclusion\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 AI \u8216\'20\'18influencers\u8217\'20\'19 are deepfaking their faces onto real women\u8217\'20\'19s bodies\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAI \u8216\'20\'18influencers\u8217\'20\'19 on \uc2 Instagram\uc2  have racked up \u8230\'20\'26 millions of views by stealing reels from real women to make the AI seem more \u8216\'20\'18believable\u8217\'20\'19,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.404media.co/ai-influencers-are-deepfaking-their-faces-onto-real-womens-bodies/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports 404 Media}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 How a \u8216\'20\'18pretty tax\u8217\'20\'19 in the music industry limits female artists\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWithin the major label music industry, it has been an open secret that femme artists are afflicted by something like a \u8216\'20\'18pretty tax\u8217\'20\'19,\u8221\'20\'1D Julianne Escobedo Shepherd {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://flaminghydra.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 writes in Flaming Hydra}}}\uc2 . It costs a lot to develop artists who require make-up and a glam team so labels have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.billboard.com/culture/lifestyle/musicians-glam-hairstylists-makeup-cost-analysis-1235618969/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hesitant}}}\uc2  to invest in some of these women.\par \par \uc2 Ten years on, what happened to the 276 Nigerian girls snatched from their school?\par \par \uc2 A decade ago almost 300 schoolgirls were abducted from a school in Chibok, Nigeria, by the Islamic militant group \uc2 Boko Haram\uc2 . About 100 of those abductees (now women) are still missing. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2024/apr/11/nigeria-chibok-boko-haram-girls-school-abductions-islamist-militants-borno-yobe-katsina-kaduna"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Guardian revisits the abduction}}}\uc2  and looks at the \u8220\'20\'1Csuspicion and stigma\u8221\'20\'1D that surrounds the women were recovered.\par \par \uc2 The week in paintriarchy\par \par \uc2 Unless you\u8217\'20\'19re immensely talented, extremely lucky, or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2021/aug/17/why-would-anyone-pay-500000-for-a-painting-by-hunter-biden"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Joe Biden\u8217\'20\'19s son}}}\uc2  then it can be difficult to break into the art scene. So I have a lot of sympathy for a 51-year-old frustrated artist working in a museum in Germany who decided to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/apr/09/german-art-museum-fires-worker-for-hanging-his-own-painting-in-gallery?"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 hang his own painting}}}\uc2  on the museum walls in the hopes of getting his break. Munich\u8217\'20\'19s Pinakothek der Moderne has said it won\u8217\'20\'19t comment on the painting\u8217\'20\'19s style or subject because it doesn\u8217\'20\'19t want to encourage copycats. \u8220\'20\'1CAll I can say is that we did not receive any positive feedback on the addition from visitors to the gallery,\u8221\'20\'1D a spokesperson said. Ouch.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240413ek4d001gu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
