\par\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 Trump selling Bibles may be desperation \u8211\'20\'13 but that shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t cheer anyone up\b0\par\par\uc2 Arwa Mahdawi \par \uc2 1,322 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 March 2024\par 16:09 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Despite mockery, Trump has sold trading cards, sneakers, cologne and perfume \u8211\'20\'13 and manages to get the last laugh\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  is a Bible salesman now\par \par \uc2 In the beginning, God created the heavens and the earth and, of course, \uc2 Donald John Trump\uc2 . The former US president, as we all know, and as he has repeatedly told us, is God\u8217\'20\'19s gift to humanity. He\u8217\'20\'19s basically {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/mar/26/biden-trump-new-york-court-hearing"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jesus}}}\uc2  \u8230\'20\'26 if Jesus were a blond sexual {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/may/10/trump-trial-verdict-white-house-2024-run"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 predator}}}\uc2  from Queens.\par \par \uc2 As if there were ever any doubt that Trump \u8211\'20\'13 who has been accused of sexual misconduct by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2020/sep/17/amy-dorris-donald-trump-women-who-accuse-sexual-misconduct"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than 25 women}}}\uc2  and is facing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/mar/22/trump-wants-to-be-handcuffed-for-court-appearance-in-stormy-daniels-case-sources-say"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 34 criminal charges}}}\uc2  for paying hush money to an adult film star \u8211\'20\'13 is a pious man, he is now hawking Bibles. Earlier this week, the presumptive Republican nominee {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/mar/26/trump-selling-bible"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 made headlines}}}\uc2  for endorsing a patriotic version of the Bible. \u8220\'20\'1CHappy Holy Week! Let\u8217\'20\'19s Make America Pray Again,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/posts/112162741690113521"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump said}}}\uc2  as he announced his latest scheme. You can get your hands on the book \u8211\'20\'13 the only version endorsed by Trump \u8211\'20\'13 for just $59.99 through a website, GodBlessTheUSABible.com.\par \par \uc2 Where are all the proceeds going? Good question. An FAQ on the site clarifies that Trump is not selling the Bible directly but states that \u8220\'20\'1CGodBlessTheUSABible.com uses \uc2 Donald J Trump\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s name, likeness and image under paid license from CIC Ventures LLC\u8221\'20\'1D. CIC Ventures is a company that Trump reported owning in his 2023 financial disclosure. In short: it looks like he is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/26/us/politics/trump-bible.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  getting royalties}}}\uc2  from the arrangement.\par \par \uc2 Trump\u8217\'20\'19s superpower is the fact he has absolutely no shame whatsoever; the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2024-03-27/trump-is-cash-strapped-even-with-7-2-billion-on-paper-big-take?embedded-checkout=true"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cash-strapped}}}\uc2  candidate will do whatever it takes to make a buck. He\u8217\'20\'19s capitalized on his legal troubles by selling merchandise with his {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/aug/25/trump-jail-heigh-weight-fundraising"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mugshot on it}}}\uc2 , for example. A couple of years ago, he was peddling {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/dec/15/trump-mocked-superhero-digital-card-collection"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 digital trading cards}}}\uc2  depicting him dressed up as a superhero. (\u8220\'20\'1COnly $99 each!\u8221\'20\'1D) Earlier this year, he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/feb/18/trump-launches-gold-high-top-sneaker-line-a-day-after-350m-court-ruling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched his own sneaker brand}}}\uc2 , selling Never Surrender High-Tops for $399. While shopping for the shoes, you could also pick up Trump-branded Victory47 cologne and perfume for $99 a bottle. Then, of course, there\u8217\'20\'19s Truth Social: the \uc2 Twitter\uc2  clone {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/media/2022/mar/16/truth-social-donald-trump-failing-anti-twitter-platform"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump launched in 2022}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 All of these recent business ventures have inspired much mockery. Despite the copious jokes, however, Trump has always somehow managed to get the last laugh. His digital trading card selection sold out in less than a day, netting {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/dec/17/donald-trumps-digital-trading-card-collection-sells-out-in-less-than-a-day#:~:text=The%20site%20said%20on%20Friday,and%20shared%20by%20anyone%20online."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $4.5m in sales}}}\uc2 . His sneakers also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/feb/20/reaction-trump-shoe-sneaker-con"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sold out}}}\uc2  hours after launch. As for loss-making Truth Social? That went public on Tuesday and quickly achieved {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/mar/26/trump-truth-social-public-new-york"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a valuation of almost $8bn}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Selling Bibles, of course, is rather different from selling sneakers or trading cards. Might this be a bridge too far for Trump\u8217\'20\'19s followers?\par \par \uc2 There has certainly been some criticism of the venture from conservatives. Commentator {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/Morning_Joe/status/1772943077990097095?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Charlie Sykes, for example, slammed him}}}\uc2  for \u8220\'20\'1Ccommodifying the Bible during Holy Week\u8221\'20\'1D. However, others on the right are singing the Trump Bible\u8217\'20\'19s praises. \u8220\'20\'1CFrom a Christian perspective, this is one of the the greatest spiritual moments in US history,\u8221\'20\'1D Tulsa preacher {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.rollingstone.com/politics/politics-features/jackson-lahmeyer-christian-nationalist-conspiracy-theorist-pastors-for-trump-1234649049/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jackson Lahmeyer}}}\uc2  told {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/RightWingWatch/status/1773416599036309697?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Real America\u8217\'20\'19s Voice}}}\uc2 , a rightwing news network.\par \par \uc2 All in all, it\u8217\'20\'19s unlikely that the white evangelical Christians who are Trump\u8217\'20\'19s most passionate followers care about the hypocrisy of Trump selling Bibles. These people don\u8217\'20\'19t actually labour under the delusion that their hero is a man of God. They just know he\u8217\'20\'19s a useful means to an end. A {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2024/03/15/5-facts-about-religion-and-americans-views-of-donald-trump/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pew Research Center report}}}\uc2  released earlier this month found: \u8220\'20\'1CMost people who view Trump positively don\u8217\'20\'19t think he is especially religious himself. But many think he stands up for people with religious beliefs like theirs.\u8221\'20\'1D In other words: they don\u8217\'20\'19t care if Trump personally practices what they preach; they just want him to legislate in a way that means others are forced to follow these practices.\par \par \uc2 This isn\u8217\'20\'19t to say that the Bible venture is some sort of genius strategy by Trump. It is, as many people have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://news.yahoo.com/trump-bible-stunt-isn-t-143328517.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pointed out}}}\uc2 , clearly something of a desperate move by a man who is having trouble {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/world/us/trump-cant-match-bidens-2024-fundraising-republicans-campaign-says-2024-03-28/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fundraising}}}\uc2  and who knows that if he\u8217\'20\'19s not headed to the White House he may be headed to jail. \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  is weak and desperate \u8211\'20\'13 both as a man and a candidate for president,\u8221\'20\'1D James Singer, a spokesperson for the Biden campaign, crowed on Monday. Trump may well be desperate, but that shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t cheer anyone up \u8211\'20\'13 least of all the Biden campaign. Few things are more dangerous than a desperate man with nothing to lose.\par \par \uc2 Former \uc2 Kansas City Chiefs\uc2  cheerleader Krystal Anderson, 40, dies after giving birth\par \par \uc2 Anderson had been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/krystal-anderson-kansas-city-chiefs-cheerleader-dies-giving-birth/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 diagnosed with sepsis}}}\uc2  during her pregnancy and, after delivering her stillborn daughter, she experienced organ failure. This is not some tragic one-off: it\u8217\'20\'19s part of a growing national crisis. Maternal deaths in the US have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2023/jul/03/us-maternal-deaths-doubled-two-decades"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than doubled since 1999}}}\uc2  ; the US has the highest maternal mortality rate among industrialized countries. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/apr/19/black-mothers-birth-maternal-mortality"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Black women}}}\uc2  (Anderson was Black) have the highest maternal mortality rates \u8211\'20\'13 almost {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://projects.apnews.com/features/2023/from-birth-to-death/black-women-maternal-mortality-rate.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 three times}}}\uc2  the rate for white women. Activists say this is partly because of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://projects.apnews.com/features/2023/from-birth-to-death/black-women-maternal-mortality-rate.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutionalized racism}}}\uc2  : Black women are not taken seriously by their healthcare professionals when they raise issues \u8211\'20\'13 not even if they\u8217\'20\'19re a superstar like Serena Williams. \u8220\'20\'1CNo one was really listening to what I was saying,\u8221\'20\'1D wrote Williams {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.elle.com/life-love/a39586444/how-serena-williams-saved-her-own-life/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in a 2022 essay}}}\uc2  about her traumatic birth. \u8220\'20\'1CBeing heard and appropriately treated was the difference between life or death for me.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  expresses skepticism in \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill hearing\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, the supreme court {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/mar/26/supreme-court-abortion-pill-takeaways"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 heard oral arguments}}}\uc2  in \uc2 US Food and Drug Administration\uc2  v Alliance for Hippocratic Medicine, the first \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  case to reach the supreme court since it overturned {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Roe v Wade}}}\uc2 . The anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  doctors arguing the case may have gone a little too far in their efforts to ban access to a common \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill, mifepristone, as even conservative justices seemed skeptical of their arguments. However, the hearing did bring new attention to the Comstock Act, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/03/29/politics/comstock-act-alito-thomas-abortion/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 19th-century obscenity law}}}\uc2 , and its potential to be weaponized by anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  extremists. \u8220\'20\'1C[I]f Republicans want to enforce the Comstock Act as a nationwide total \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, they don\u8217\'20\'19t need to win control of Congress,\u8221\'20\'1D writes {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2024/mar/27/us-supreme-court-anti-choice-abortion-pills-case"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Moira Donegan in the Guardian}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CAll they need is the White House.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 People are drinking \u8216\'20\'18sexy water\u8217\'20\'19 now\par \par \uc2 What fresh hell is this? You don\u8217\'20\'19t want to know. But if, actually, you do want to know, then Caitlin Dewey has a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://linksiwouldgchatyou.substack.com/p/performative-hydration-has-gone-too"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 refreshing read}}}\uc2  on performative hydration and how water got entangled with \u8220\'20\'1Cself-care\u8221\'20\'1D culture.\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18I had high breasts, most of my eggs \u8230\'20\'26 [and] a pep in my step that had yet to run out \u8230\'20\'26 \u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Behold one of the many eyebrow-raising lines in a the Cut essay titled {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://link.mail.beehiiv.com/ss/c/u001.ZEAz7Uq2KesQq-soVMJjwxZCFg8QPmd8LJjzcpOPK6NQIoUFtRFVek4VF8MegC7Xtrz2z4RAo3IPlbmjyicB_EoQYjZSIEQZp8hWK41bqq_Kg1cn8hmNKs4UGD54XOTpt2it6uKW0yFSumALo8l67A/450/lV7rl0wzTh-qyq9ZieRb0A/h6/h001.km5IdHtRtt-lLm0RfLsH-CF_GfZMZ73KwKJ-2_DQimg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Case for Marrying an Older Man}}}\uc2 , which is a masterclass in internalized misogyny.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Taliban\uc2  will resume stoning women to death\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe international community has chosen to remain silent in the face of these violations of women\u8217\'20\'19s rights,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2024/mar/28/taliban-edict-to-resume-stoning-women-to-death-met-with-horror"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one activist said}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A human rights official has resigned from the US state department over Gaza\par \par \uc2 Annelle Sheline {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2024/03/27/opinions/gaza-israel-resigning-state-department-sheline/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  she was unable to serve as a representative of a government that \u8220\'20\'1Cwas directly enabling what the \uc2 International Court of Justice\uc2  has said could plausibly be a genocide in Gaza\u8221\'20\'1D. Sheline\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/mar/27/state-department-resignation-gaza-biden-policy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 resignation}}}\uc2  comes as Gaza is on the brink of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2024/mar/26/israel-unrwa-palestine"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 famine}}}\uc2 . And, as children in Gaza starve to death, the US continues to blithely enable atrocities: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/us-has-signed-off-more-bombs-warplanes-israel-washington-post-reports-2024-03-29/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in recent days}}}\uc2 , Biden authorized the transfer of billions of dollars worth of bombs to Israel.\par \par \uc2 The week in pawtriarchy\par \par \uc2 A wildlife rescue in England took in a cute little baby hedgehog, fed it and tried to nurse it back to health. \u8220\'20\'1COur hearts melted,\u8221\'20\'1D one volunteer said. Then they realised it was actually a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bbc.com/news/uk-england-manchester-68656787"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pompom from a bobble hat}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240330ek3u001gu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
