\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 What is the  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  case in front of the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  right now?\b0\par\par\uc2 Carter Sherman \par \uc2 995 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 March 2024\par 17:42 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 On Tuesday the justices heard oral arguments on a rightwing effort to roll back access to a key \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill\par \par \uc2 Less than two years after it overturned Roe v Wade and ended the national right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  is back on the frontlines of the American \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  wars.\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, the court heard oral arguments in one of the most highly watched cases of the session, which could dramatically curtail access to mifepristone, a drug typically used in medication abortions. The court is reviewing decisions made by the \uc2 Food and Drug Administration\uc2  (\uc2 FDA\uc2 ) to loosen restrictions on the drug, such as allowing non-physicians to prescribe it, as well as letting providers prescribe it through telehealth rather than in-person appointments.\par \par \uc2 Any decision to restrict mifepristone will affect everyone in the US, not only those who live in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2023/nov/10/state-abortion-laws-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 16 states}}}\uc2  that have banned nearly all abortions. This case could also have wide-ranging consequences for the \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s future decision-making.\par \par \uc2 A decision from the nation\u8217\'20\'19s highest court in the case will probably arrive by summer 2024.\par \par \uc2 What is mifepristone?\par \par \uc2 Medication abortions typically use two drugs, mifepristone and misoprostol, taken several hours apart. While mifepristone generally stops a pregnancy from progressing, misoprostol makes the uterus cramp, bleed and empty out \u8211\'20\'13 similar to a miscarriage. Medication abortions now account for 63% of all US abortions.\par \par \uc2 The plaintiffs in the case claim that mifepristone, which was first approved by the \uc2 FDA\uc2  for use in abortions in 2000, is unsafe and understudied. However, more than 100 studies conducted across three decades and more than two dozen countries have found that mifepristone is safe, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2023/04/01/health/abortion-pill-safety.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a New York Times analysis}}}\uc2  found. The \uc2 World Health Organization\uc2  has also outlined a protocol by which women can use mifepristone to safely \u8220\'20\'1Cself-manage\u8221\'20\'1D their own abortions.\par \par \uc2 What has happened in the case so far?\par \par \uc2 The case was first filed in late 2022, just months after the supreme court overturned Roe, by a group called the Alliance for Hippocratic Medicine, which includes doctors who oppose \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It is being represented in court by the \uc2 Alliance Defending Freedom\uc2 , a powerhouse Christian law firm that champions conservative causes such as ending \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 ADF\uc2  filed the case in federal court in Amarillo, Texas, which guaranteed that only one judge would oversee it: the US district judge Matthew Kacsmaryk, a conservative appointed by the former president \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 . In April 2023, Kacsmaryk ruled to suspend the \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s approval of mifepristone, peppering his decision with rhetoric widely used by the anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  movement.\par \par \uc2 In August last year, the conservative fifth circuit court of appeals narrowed Kacsmaryk\u8217\'20\'19s ruling. The court found that it was too late to completely suspend the \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s approval of mifepristone, but reversed more recent measures that the \uc2 FDA\uc2  had taken to expand access to mifepristone, including allowing non-physicians to prescribe the drug and eliminating a requirement that people pick up mifepristone in person.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 FDA\uc2  appealed that ruling up to the supreme court, as did Danco Laboratories, which manufactures mifepristone. The supreme court paused the ruling as the litigation made its way through the judicial system, so the drug\u8217\'20\'19s availability has not changed for now.\par \par \uc2 What will the supreme court consider?\par \par \uc2 In addition to debating the \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s changes to how mifepristone is regulated, the supreme court justices focused part of the oral arguments on the question of \u8220\'20\'1Cstanding\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 whether these doctors even have the legal right to bring this case. Generally, people who file lawsuits have to prove that they have been harmed or will be without the help of a court.\par \par \uc2 The Alliance for Hippocratic Medicine has argued that its doctors have treated women dealing with complications from medication abortions and may be forced to do so again. But the \uc2 FDA\uc2  has contended that Alliance\u8217\'20\'19s claim is speculative and highly unlikely, given mifepristone\u8217\'20\'19s proven safety record, and said that the Alliance\u8217\'20\'19s case for its standing doesn\u8217\'20\'19t meet the legal threshold needed to establish it.\par \par \uc2 What happens if the supreme court cuts access to mifepristone?\par \par \uc2 If the court rules that only physicians can prescribe mifepristone, this will narrow the pool of clinicians eligible to prescribe the drug. However, the potential hit to telehealth would have a particularly sweeping impact on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access across the country.\par \par \uc2 First permitted by the \uc2 FDA\uc2  amid the coronavirus pandemic, telehealth abortions now account for about 16% of all US abortions and are available even in states that ban the procedure, thanks to blue state laws that protect providers who prescribe and ship the pill anywhere in the country. Over summer 2023, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers facilitated roughly 14,000 abortions each month through telehealth.\par \par \uc2 Telehealth \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers may pivot to using only misoprostol to perform abortions. Although misoprostol-only abortions are safe and effective, they can have more side-effects than abortions performed using both mifepristone and misoprostol. However, many \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers said they had yet to make a final decision about how to handle such a ruling.\par \par \uc2 Regardless of what the supreme court decides, mifepristone will remain available outside the formal US healthcare system. Since the demise of Roe, people have increasingly turned to self-managing their abortions using pills provided through online businesses and community networks of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights activists. Because these kinds of organizations typically get their pills from overseas pharmacies, changes to \uc2 FDA\uc2  regulations will not affect their mifepristone supply and distribution.\par \par \uc2 Ultimately, the consequences of this case could also stretch far beyond \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . If the supreme court agrees to let judges overrule the \uc2 FDA\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s decision-making processes, the legality and availability of any drug \u8211\'20\'13 particularly those that have been politicized, like vaccines \u8211\'20\'13 could be challenged.\par \par \uc2 This explainer, first published on 17 August 2023 and\par \par \uc2 co-written by Maya Yang, is being regularly updated to ensure that it reflects the current situation as best as possible.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240322ek3m00001\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
