\par\par \uc2 Music\par \b \uc2 Olivia Rodrigo stops distribution of morning-after pill at her concerts\b0\par\par\uc2 Richard Luscombe \par \uc2 717 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 March 2024\par 14:39 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Singer was praised for earlier allowing distribution of Plan B at her shows, but is now stepping back citing the presence of children\par \par \uc2 Olivia Rodrigo has reportedly stepped in to halt the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/mar/13/olivia-rodrigo-concert-morning-after-pill"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 distribution of free contraceptives}}}\uc2  and the morning-after pill at her concerts, days after the American singer was praised for encouraging young people to take responsibility for their sexual health.\par \par \uc2 According to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  organizations {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://variety.com/2024/music/news/olivia-rodrigo-abortion-funds-not-allowed-distribute-plan-b-condom-1235943079/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cited by Variety}}}\uc2 , Rodrigo\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cteam\u8221\'20\'1D became concerned about the messaging and insisted groups no longer pass out lubrication, condoms and the emergency contraceptive pill known as Plan B because \u8220\'20\'1Cchildren are present at the concerts\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 They will still be allowed to have booths at dates on Rodrigo\u8217\'20\'19s Guts world tour, which continues on Saturday in Milwaukee, Wisconsin \u8211\'20\'13 but only to hand out information and materials such as hats, T-shirts, stickers and badges.\par \par \uc2 Women\u8217\'20\'19s sexual health groups say they are dismayed by the decision, which also follows a backlash by conservatives to the handouts that took place in partnership with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.eifoundation.org/partners/olivia-rodrigos-fund-4-good/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fund 4 Good}}}\uc2  initiative, which the three-time Grammy winner says she set up to build \u8220\'20\'1Can equitable and just future for all women, girls and people seeking reproductive health freedom\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Destini Spaeth, chair of the Prairie \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund, which was present at Friday night\u8217\'20\'19s Rodrigo concert in St Paul, Minnesota, told Variety that she strongly disagreed with the move. \u8220\'20\'1CThere is something really positive about a 16- or 15-year-old having a Plan B and a few condoms in her dresser to use as she needs it,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSex and sexual health tools, whether that be \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Plan B, condoms, are villainized because you\u8217\'20\'19re [seen as being] promiscuous. We don\u8217\'20\'19t look at it as a sign of responsibility. [But] if the kids aren\u8217\'20\'19t getting the education they need in school, at least they can rely on reproductive health organizations in their communities to get that information and resources to them.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Rodrigo\u8217\'20\'19s representatives did not immediately respond to a request for comment from the Guardian.\par \par \uc2 News that contraceptives and Plan B were being handed out at concerts in partnership with Fund 4 Good quickly went viral and earned the singer widespread praise, even though the initial call to distribute them came from the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  groups themselves.\par \par \uc2 Talking {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/mar/13/olivia-rodrigo-concert-morning-after-pill"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 to the Guardian this week}}}\uc2  after a concert in St Louis, Stephanie Kraft Sheley, project director of Right by You, said: \u8220\'20\'1CShe invited us, but it was our decision to bring it and hand it out. It fills my heart with so much joy and gratitude to Olivia, and it shows how well received it will be when other artists step up and do this. I hope they follow this example.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 There was also criticism of the 21-year-old artist. \u8220\'20\'1CCurious how the Disney Channel churns out so many high priestesses of child sacrifice,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BreitbartNews/status/1768247151467942140?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a tweet}}}\uc2  by the rightwing television channel Breitbart News said, referring to Rodrigo\u8217\'20\'19s career beginnings.\par \par \uc2 Others accused Rodrigo of operating \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/40daysforlife/status/1767966221276778710?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  dispensaries}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D at concerts and being a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/maryarchived/status/1768302873975152759?s=20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 satanic [\b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 ] industry plant}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 But Jade Hurley, communications manager for the DC \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund, told Variety the rightwing backlash is based on false information. \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s disappointing that extremists are causing a moral panic over something they don\u8217\'20\'19t even understand,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey don\u8217\'20\'19t know the difference between emergency contraception and the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill, which are two completely different things.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Abortions are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2023/nov/10/state-abortion-laws-us"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 illegal in Missouri}}}\uc2 , where Rodrigo performed her St Louis concert on Tuesday, but there is no law prohibiting the distribution of emergency contraception.\par \par \uc2 Still, the order to stop their distribution came directly from Rodrigo\u8217\'20\'19s team, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.jezebel.com/olivia-rodrigos-team-reportedly-wont-let-abortion-funds-hand-out-plan-b-or-condoms-at-shows-anymore"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jezebel reported}}}\uc2 , following the media coverage and because they feared children could too easily access the products.\par \par \uc2 Robin Frisella, community engagement director of the Missouri \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund, told Variety in a statement before Friday night\u8217\'20\'19s concert that it would honor the request.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhile we are disappointed to learn that other \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds will not get the same opportunity, we are encouraged by the overwhelmingly positive response,\u8221\'20\'1D the statement said. \u8220\'20\'1CWe can\u8217\'20\'19t speak to why this decision was made, but we hope this conversation highlights the work being done by \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds across the country.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240316ek3g001rx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
