\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Missouri law prevents divorce during pregnancy \u8211\'20\'13 even in cases of violence\b0\par\par\uc2 Lizzie Tribone \par \uc2 890 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 March 2024\par 16:18 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The statute, which can lead to reproductive coercion in a state that has banned \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has recently gained nationwide attention\par \par \uc2 At six months pregnant, H decided enough was enough. She had endured years of abuse from her husband and had recently discovered he was also physically violent towards her child. She contacted an attorney to help her get a divorce.\par \par \uc2 But she was stopped short. Her lawyer told her that she could not finalize a divorce in Missouri because she was pregnant. \u8220\'20\'1CI just absolutely felt defeated,\u8221\'20\'1D she said. H returned to the house she shared with her abuser, sleeping in her child\u8217\'20\'19s room on the floor and continuing to face violence. On the night before she gave birth, she slept in the most secure room in the house: on the tile floor in the basement, with the family\u8217\'20\'19s dogs.\par \par \uc2 Under a Missouri statute that has recently gained nationwide attention, every petitioner for divorce is required to disclose their pregnancy status. In practice, experts say, those who are pregnant are barred from legally dissolving their marriage. \u8220\'20\'1CThe application [of the law] is an outright ban,\u8221\'20\'1D said Danielle Drake, attorney at Parks & Drake. When Drake learned her then husband was having an affair, her own divorce stalled because she was pregnant. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/factcheck/2024/02/28/pregnant-women-divorce-missouri-texas-arkansas-arizona/72763848007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Two}}}\uc2  other states have similar laws: Texas and Arkansas.\par \par \uc2 It took H three months after the birth of her second child to muster the finances and courage to file for divorce again. She believes that had she been able to obtain a divorce when she first tried, she would have been able to leave an abusive environment many months earlier.\par \par \uc2 The original intent of the statute in Missouri, which originated in 1973, was \u8220\'20\'1Cnoble\u8221\'20\'1D, Ashley Aune, a Democratic representative, said, as it tried to ensure that a mother and her child were provided for by settling custody arrangements and child support after the child\u8217\'20\'19s birth.\par \par \uc2 But in practice, it has created barriers for pregnant people seeking divorce. The precise number of women the current statute affects is unknown \u8211\'20\'13 no entity collects this information. But the problem, Synergy Services, a non-profit that provides supportive services to people experiencing violence in Greater Kansas City, said they regularly receive requests for support from pregnant women unable to divorce abusive husbands because of the law.\par \par \uc2 Advocates warn the law can enable reproductive coercion, a term referring to behaviors that aim to control the course of another person\u8217\'20\'19s reproductive autonomy. Common examples include forcing a person to continue or terminate a pregnancy, sabotaging their birth control or tracking their ovulation cycle.\par \par \uc2 When the abuse was ongoing, H says she would not have used the term to describe her experience. She does now. Her first child was six months old when she was raped by her former husband and became pregnant again. \u8220\'20\'1CI think he knew, in his mind, that it would keep me as his property,\u8221\'20\'1D H told the Guardian.\par \par \uc2 Aune recently introduced House bill 2402, which would give a family court judge more discretion to grant an expedited divorce in cases of pregnancy. \u8220\'20\'1CI want a judge to be able to look at that and say, \u8216\'20\'18OK, you\u8217\'20\'19re right. This is a situation where we need to close this divorce out,\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D Aune said. The bill has yet to be brought to a vote.\par \par \uc2 Missouri is particularly restrictive when it comes to reproductive health and autonomy. It was one of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://missouriindependent.com/2022/06/24/abortion-is-now-illegal-in-missouri-in-wake-of-u-s-supreme-court-ruling/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first}}}\uc2  to ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after Roe v Wade was overturned in 2022, including in cases of rape and incest. Research shows that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  restrictions can effectively {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.vice.com/en/article/dy3yny/abortion-bans-domestic-abusers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 give cover to}}}\uc2  reproductive coercion and sexual violence: the National Hotline for Domestic Violence said it saw a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.vice.com/en/article/dy3yny/abortion-bans-domestic-abusers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 99% increase}}}\uc2  in calls during the first year after the loss of the constitutional right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Advocates are {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.kcur.org/politics-elections-and-government/2024-03-06/missouri-advocates-gather-signatures-to-legalize-abortion-but-republicans-are-trying-to-stop-it"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 currently}}}\uc2  trying to gather enough signatures to put a constitutional amendment on the ballot that would make \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  legal until fetal viability, or around 24 weeks.\par \par \uc2 In Missouri, homicide was the third leading cause of deaths in connection with pregnancy between 2018\u8211\'20\'132022, the majority (75%) of which occurred among Black women, according to a 2023 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://health.mo.gov/news/newsitem/uuid/8643d922-4c92-4744-8e37-a372cb018033/missouri-s-maternal-mortality-report-published"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  by the Missouri department of health and senior services, which examines maternal mortality data. In every case, the perpetrator was a current or former partner. And in 2022, 23,252 individuals in the state received services after reporting domestic violence, according to the latest {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cm20-s3-mcadsv.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/ResourceFiles/b6a28450123a40e3a1824ae5b8b1550eStatewide_DV_FINAL_highres.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reporting}}}\uc2  from Missouri Coalition Against Domestic & Sexual Violence, which compiles data from direct service providers in the state.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t believe it is hyperbole when I say this legislation could literally save lives,\u8221\'20\'1D said Matthew Huffman, chief public affairs officer at Missouri Coalition Against Domestic & Sexual Violence, a state-wide membership association of domestic and sexual violence service providers.\par \par \uc2 Having \u8220\'20\'1Cthe agency and ability to have a divorce finalized puts you in a place where you can begin to regain control of your life\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 In the US, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thehotline.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 domestic violence hotline}}}\uc2  is 1-800-799-SAFE (7233). In the UK, call the national {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nationaldahelpline.org.uk/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 domestic abuse helpline}}}\uc2  on 0808 2000 247, or visit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.womensaid.org.uk/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Women\u8217\'20\'19s Aid}}}\uc2 . In Australia, the national {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.1800respect.org.au/help-and-support/telephone-and-online-counselling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 family violence counselling service}}}\uc2  is on 1800 737 732. Other international helplines may be found via {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.befrienders.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.befrienders.org}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240315ek3f0025t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
