\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Biden\u8217\'20\'19s State of the Union guests include mother whose IVF was canceled and Kate Cox\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in Washington \par \uc2 811 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 March 2024\par 19:04 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 White House says LaTorya Beasley and Texas mother forced to travel outside her state for a doctor-recommended \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be guests\par \par \uc2 An Alabama mother who saw a second round of IVF canceled after the state supreme court {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/feb/20/alabama-supreme-court-frozen-embryos-children-ruling-ivf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ruled that embryos were children}}}\uc2  and a Texas mother {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/dec/16/abortion-ban-lawsuits-pregnancy-complication-emergency-kate-cox"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 forced to travel outside her state}}}\uc2  for a doctor-recommended \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  were due to attend \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s State of the Union address on Thursday, as guests of the first lady, Jill Biden.\par \par \uc2 The White House {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefing-room/statements-releases/2024/03/07/the-white-house-announces-guest-list-for-the-first-ladys-box-for-the-2024-state-of-the-union-address/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  the cases of Latorya Beasley of Birmingham, Alabama, and Kate Cox, from Dallas, Texas, showed \u8220\'20\'1Chow the overturning of Roe v Wade has disrupted access to reproductive healthcare for women and families across the country\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Roe v Wade, the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  ruling that guaranteed federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturned}}}\uc2  by the rightwing-dominated court in June 2022.\par \par \uc2 Last month, the Alabama IVF decision caused {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/society/2024/feb/24/us-infertility-patients-ivf-alabama-ruling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 national uproar}}}\uc2 . As Democrats seized on a rightwing threat to reproductive rights of the kind that has fueled a string of successful election campaigns, Republicans scrambled to say they supported IVF. On Wednesday the Republican Alabama governor, \uc2 Kay Ivey\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/mar/07/alabama-ivf-protection-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 signed a law}}}\uc2  protecting IVF providers.\par \par \uc2 In a statement, the White House said: \u8220\'20\'1CStories like Kate\u8217\'20\'19s and Latorya\u8217\'20\'19s should never happen in America. But Republican elected officials want to impose this reality on women nationwide.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Amanda Zurawski, a Texas woman who nearly died of septic shock when she was denied a medically necessary \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , is also due to attend.\par \par \uc2 Republicans are on the defensive. At an event hosted by Axios in Washington on Thursday, Byron Donalds, a far-right Florida congressman touted as a vice-presidential pick for \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , parried repeated questions about whether federal protection was needed but said: \u8220\'20\'1CIVF is a procedure many couples use throughout our country.\u8221\'20\'1D Donalds also said he supported six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans.\par \par \uc2 The head of Donalds\u8217\'20\'19 caucus, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/mar/07/mike-johnson-state-of-the-union"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mike Johnson, the US House speaker}}}\uc2 , also used his State of the Union guest list to highlight reproductive rights as an political issue, inviting Janet Durig, executive director of the Capitol Hill Pregnancy Center in Washington DC, described as \u8220\'20\'1Cone of the hundreds of pro-life centers or churches targeted and vandalised\u8221\'20\'1D after the fall of Roe v Wade.\par \par \uc2 State of the Union guest lists are political by definition. Johnson\u8217\'20\'19s list reflected the Republican agenda, highlighting crime (which is down nationwide), the fallout from the withdrawal from Afghanistan, and support for Israel in its war with \uc2 Hamas\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Among Johnson\u8217\'20\'19s guests were two parents of US service members killed in the evacuation of Kabul in 2021; the mother and son of a US-Israeli soldier held hostage by \uc2 Hamas\uc2 ; and a French-Israeli hostage released by \uc2 Hamas\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Johnson also invited the parents of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/feb/09/putin-says-release-of-us-journalist-evan-gershkovich-may-be-possible"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Evan Gershkovich}}}\uc2 , a Wall Street Journal reporter held in Russia; two New York police officers \u8220\'20\'1Cattacked in January by a mob of illegal immigrants in Times Square\u8221\'20\'1D; parents of people killed by a person who is undocumented and by fentanyl poisoning; the widow of Mike Gill, a former Trump administration official killed by a carjacker in Washington; campaigners against trans participation in women\u8217\'20\'19s sports; the Turkish basketball star and campaigner Enes Freedom; and the pastor of Johnson\u8217\'20\'19s Louisiana church.\par \par \uc2 Announcing its own list, the White House {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefing-room/statements-releases/2024/03/07/the-white-house-announces-guest-list-for-the-first-ladys-box-for-the-2024-state-of-the-union-address/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  guests were picked \u8220\'20\'1Cbecause they personify issues or themes to be addressed by the president in his speech, or they embody the Biden-Harris administration\u8217\'20\'19s policies at work for the American people\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Other guests set to sit with Jill Biden and Doug Emhoff, husband of the vice-president, \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , included an oncology nurse and a cancer patient; a gun control advocate from Uvalde, Texas, the scene of an elementary school massacre; the president of the \uc2 United Auto Workers\uc2  and a member of that union; and a veteran of Bloody Sunday, the historic civil rights march in Selma, Alabama, in 1965.\par \par \uc2 The governor of the Gila River Indian Community in Arizona, a naval commander back from protecting Red Sea shipping against attacks by Houthi rebels in Yemen, the women\u8217\'20\'19s health advocate Maria Shriver, and a military spouse were also set to attend.\par \par \uc2 Ulf Kristersson\uc2 , the prime minister of Sweden, a new Nato ally, accepted an invitation. But two other high-profile international figures {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/06/world/europe/biden-state-of-the-union-olena-zelensky.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 turned the Bidens down}}}\uc2  : \uc2 Yulia Navalnaya\uc2 , the widow of the deceased Russian opposition leader {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/alexei-navalny"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alexei Navalny}}}\uc2 , and \uc2 Olena Zelenska\uc2 , the first lady of Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 Thanks to opposition from Johnson ( {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/mar/07/trump-chamberlain-putin-hitler-jim-himes"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 and Trump}}}\uc2  ), Congress is gridlocked on new aid for Ukraine in its war with Russia. The \uc2 Washington Post\uc2  also {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thedailybeast.com/us-tries-and-fails-to-seat-zelenska-near-navalnaya-at-state-of-the-union"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  that Zelenska did not want to be associated with Navalnaya because her husband once said Crimea was part of Russia, which annexed it from Ukraine in 2014.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240307ek37002mn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
