\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Two of biggest US pharmacy chains to stock mifepristone  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  pill\b0\par\par\uc2 Gloria Oladipo in New York and agency \par \uc2 508 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 March 2024\par 20:53 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Biden applauds decision by CVS and \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  to offer drug on prescription at stores in several US states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is legal\par \par \uc2 Two of the largest pharmacy chains in the US, CVS and \uc2 Walgreens\uc2 , will start selling the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pill mifepristone on prescription at stores in several US states later this month, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2024/03/01/health/abortion-pills-cvs-walgreens.html?partner=slack&smid=sl-share"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  the New York Times reported}}}\uc2  on Friday, citing interviews with officials at both companies.\par \par \uc2 Joe Biden quickly applauded the decision, issuing a statement from the White House hailing an \u8220\'20\'1Cimportant milestone\u8221\'20\'1D in maintaining access to the pill and encouraged other pharmacies to pursue similar options.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWith major retail pharmacy chains newly certified to dispense medication \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , many women will soon have the option to pick up their prescription at a local, certified pharmacy \u8211\'20\'13 just as they would for any other medication,\u8221\'20\'1D the US president said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe stakes could not be higher for women across America,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par \uc2 The two pharmacy chains will not be providing the medicine by mail, the newspaper reported.\par \par \uc2 In the coming weeks, CVS will begin filling prescriptions for the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  medication mifepristone in Massachusetts and Rhode Island, the Times reported. The pharmacy chain said it received certification to dispense the medication in states where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is still legal. And CVS intended to add those states to its distribution \u8220\'20\'1Con a rolling basis\u8221\'20\'1D, chain spokeswoman Amy Thibault said to the Associated Press.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  will begin providing the pill in a select number of pharmacies in California, New York, Massachusetts, Pennsylvania and Illinois.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe are beginning a phased rollout in select locations to allow us to ensure quality, safety and privacy for our patients, providers and team members,\u8221\'20\'1D a \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  spokesperson, Fraser Engerman, told the Times.\par \par \uc2 Although both chains have plans to expand dispensing of the medication to other states where it is legally permissible, they have held off on expanding access where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bans are in place, the Times reported.\par \par \uc2 The latest news comes as Republican-led states have widely blocked access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  in 2022 overturned the landmark 1973 Roe v Wade decision making access to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  a national right in the US.\par \par \uc2 Last December, the supreme court {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2023/dec/13/abortion-pill-us-supreme-court-mifepristone"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 agreed}}}\uc2  to hear oral arguments in a case about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  medication. The decision of that case, set for this summer, could further challenge access to mifepristone.\par \par \uc2 It was 2000 when the \uc2 FDA\uc2  approved mifepristone to terminate pregnancies of up to 10 weeks, when used with a second drug, misoprostol.\par \par \uc2 Labeling from the \uc2 FDA\uc2  for more than 20 years limited dispensing to a subset of specialty offices and clinics, due to safety concerns.\par \par \uc2 Mifepristone is taken first to dilate the cervix and block the hormone progesterone, which is needed to sustain a pregnancy. Misoprostol is taken 24 to 48 hours later, causing the uterus to contract and expel pregnancy tissue.\par \par \uc2 CVS has nearly 9,400 stores in the US. \uc2 Walgreens\uc2  has about 8,700.\par \par \uc2 Reuters and AP contributed reporting\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240301ek31002pl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
