\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 Newsom launches  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ads in Republican states to fight \u8216\'20\'18war on women\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Sam Levine in New York \par \uc2 639 \uc2 words\par \uc2 26 February 2024\par 15:04 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Series of new advertisements target Republican efforts to criminalize abortions and a \u8216\'20\'18war on travel\u8217\'20\'19 for reproductive care\par \par \uc2 California\u8217\'20\'19s governor, \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2 , is launching a series of new advertisements in Republican states targeting Republican efforts to criminalize having an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and \u8220\'20\'1Ca war on travel\u8221\'20\'1D for reproductive care.\par \par \uc2 The first advertisement by Campaign for Democracy, Newsom\u8217\'20\'19s political action committee (Pac), will air this week in Tennessee, where lawmakers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2024/feb/13/tennessee-minors-abortion-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 are considering legislation}}}\uc2  that would make it illegal for anyone who helps a minor obtain an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  without permission from their parents. Anyone found guilty of the offense could face between three and 15 years in prison.\par \par \uc2 Newsom\u8217\'20\'19s ad opens with a young woman handcuffed to a hospital bed as she cries out for help. \u8220\'20\'1CTrump Republicans want to criminalize young women who travel to receive the reproductive care they need,\u8221\'20\'1D a voiceover says. \u8220\'20\'1CDon\u8217\'20\'19t let them hold Tennessee women hostage.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Newsom unveiled the ad on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/gov-gavin-newsoms-super-pac-launches-tv-ad-targeting-gop-abortion-rcna140342"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NBC News\u8217\'20\'19s Meet the Press}}}\uc2  on Sunday. The Pac plans to air them in other states such as Alabama, Mississippi and Oklahoma that are considering similar measures.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI worry about the United States supreme court that, again, set the tone and tenor for the debate we\u8217\'20\'19re having today. And again, it\u8217\'20\'19s not just a war on travel. It\u8217\'20\'19s not just a war on reproductive healthcare. It\u8217\'20\'19s also a war on women more broadly defined, including as we know, contraceptives,\u8221\'20\'1D Newsom said.\par \par \uc2 Trump has reportedly expressed private support for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban after 16 weeks of pregnancy, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2024/02/16/us/politics/trump-abortion-ban.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to the New York Times}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CKnow what I like about 16?\u8221\'20\'1D Trump told one of these people, who was given anonymity to describe a private conversation. \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s even. It\u8217\'20\'19s four months,\u8221\'20\'1D he has said, according to the times.\par \par \uc2 Newsom was skeptical Trump would stick to 16 weeks. \u8220\'20\'1CHe supports a national ban. And if you\u8217\'20\'19re \uc2 Lindsey Graham\uc2  and others, they\u8217\'20\'19re going to bring that down well below 16. He will sign a national ban,\u8221\'20\'1D he said on Meet the Press.\par \par \uc2 Republicans this week have been scrambling to articulate a position on IVF after a ruling from the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/feb/20/alabama-supreme-court-frozen-embryos-children-ruling-ivf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alabama supreme court}}}\uc2  said that frozen embryos are children. At least {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/health/health-news/university-alabama-pauses-ivf-services-court-rules-embryos-are-childre-rcna139846"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 three clinics}}}\uc2  in the state have stopped providing IVF services.\par \par \uc2 Trump on Friday said he supported IVF and urged Alabama Republicans to \u8220\'20\'1Cact quickly to find an immediate solution to preserve\u8221\'20\'1D it. The National Republican Senate Committee, the campaign arm of senate Republicans, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2024/02/23/ivf-alabama-ruling-republicans-senate-00142953"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has also urged }}}\uc2  GOP candidates to support IVF.\par \par \uc2 The Texas governor, Greg Abbott, a Republican who leads a state where \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is essentially banned and has implemented some of the nation\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/texas-woman-sought-abortion-court-order-leave-state-rcna129087"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 harshest anti-\b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  laws}}}\uc2 , also treaded carefully when he was asked on Sunday how Texas would respond to the Alabama ruling.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CPresident Trump put out a statement on this and I think that is a goal that we all kind of want to achieve. That is, we want to make it easier for people to have babies, not make it harder,\u8221\'20\'1D he said during an appearance on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://edition.cnn.com/videos/politics/2024/02/25/gov-abbott-alabama-ivf-ruling-dana-bash-sotu-vpx.cnn"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CNN\u8217\'20\'19s State of the Union. }}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CThe IVF process is a way of giving life to even more babies.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Byron Donalds, a Florida Republican who is an ally of Trump, said on Sunday he could support a bill with national protections for IVF.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLike any type of bill that gets drafted on Capitol Hill, I want to see the devil in the details. But, yes, I could \u8211\'20\'13 I feel I could broadly support that. Because, like I said, IVF is something that is so critical to a lot of couples. It helps them breed great families. Our country needs that,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/meet-the-press/video/rep-donalds-says-he-could-broadly-support-legislation-protecting-ivf-full-interview-204891205504"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  he said on Meet the Press.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020240225ek2p001jo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
